        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC50-WHITE, Light Door Closer in White</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White Light Duty Door Closer is great for interior residential doors or on seldom used commercial doors weighing 30 to 75 pounds. Deltana's DC50 Door Closer in White is UL listed for fire rated doors. It has an adjustable latching and closing speed and is non-handed for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in <a href=\"/products/light-door-closer-deltana-dc50\"><b>Other Finishes</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana DC50 White Color Light Use Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated. R27405 UL LISTED 47V5</li>\r\n<li>Parallel mounting bracket / arm is included.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Small body profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the White Residential or Light Commercial Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>White</b></li>\r\n<li>For Door Weight: 30 - 75 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 2</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC502.pdf?v=1691095379\" target=\"new\">Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC5-install.pdf?v=1691095317\" target=\"new\">Installation Instructions & Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
